  30 |     return 1 + depth(wrap(x), n - 1)   #~ polymorphic_recursion
     |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  note: a generic function is compiled once per type it is used at, so a chain that never repeats a type never ends
  note: pass the value along unchanged, or take the recursive step in a non-generic helper
